<span class="bella-stat-label">😈 분노 - 압력</span>
<div class="bella-stat-buttons sin-buttons">
<button type="button" class="bella-stat-btn pressure" risu-trigger="adjust_cassandra_sin_pos_plus_5">+5</button>
